    *pronunciation respelling* in Normalizer stage(s), so we emit e.g. "Versailles"
    → "vair-SIGH", joined to the surrounding text. This uses the exact pipeline
    already in place (an ordered transform), needs no SSML, and works on every
    engine including the two named. This is the recommended approach.
  • If full-IPA is ever wanted for an engine that supports it, that is a *separate*
    opt-in knob on the per-engine params path (`Bundle` extras or a vocabulary
    file) — keep it out of v1.

